{"id": "permission-key-quoted", "file": ".github/workflows/verify-hosted.yml", "old": "permissions:\n  contents: read\n", "new": "permissions:\n  \"contents\": write\n", "tests": ["tests/test_workflows_hardened.py::test_every_permission_is_within_the_least_listed_for_its_workflow"], "why": "مفتاحٌ بين علامتين يقطع قراءةَ الكتلة فتُعدّ فارغةً وتمرّ الكتابة (ملاحظة Codex على #297)"}
{"id": "job-permissions-flow-mapping", "file": ".github/workflows/labels.yml", "old": "  sync:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n", "new": "  sync:\n    permissions: {contents: write}\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n", "tests": ["tests/test_workflows_hardened.py::test_every_permission_is_within_the_least_listed_for_its_workflow"], "why": "صلاحيةُ مهمّةٍ في خريطةٍ مضمَّنة لا تُقرأ بالصورة المعتمدة"}
