{"id": "action-key-quoted", "file": ".github/workflows/labels.yml", "old": "      - uses: actions/checkout@11d5960a326750d5838078e36cf38b85af677262", "new": "      - \"uses\": actions/checkout@v4", "tests": ["tests/test_workflows_hardened.py::test_every_external_action_is_pinned_to_a_full_commit"], "why": "فعلٌ بمفتاحٍ بين علامتين يخفى عن قراءة السطر"}
{"id": "permissions-key-escaped", "file": ".github/workflows/labels.yml", "old": "  sync:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n", "new": "  sync:\n    \"permiss\\u0069ons\": write-all\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n", "tests": ["tests/test_workflows_hardened.py::test_every_workflow_key_is_plain_so_the_guards_read_what_github_reads"], "why": "مفتاحٌ بين علامتين بهروبٍ يفكّه قارئُ YAML إلى permissions ولا يراه قارئُ النصّ (ملاحظة Codex الثالثة على #297)"}
