{"id": "permissions-through-an-anchor", "file": ".github/workflows/runner-canary.yml", "old": "permissions: {}", "new": "permissions: &grants {}", "tests": ["tests/test_workflows_hardened.py::test_every_workflow_key_is_plain_so_the_guards_read_what_github_reads"], "why": "مرساةٌ يستعيرها مفتاحٌ آخر فتنتقل الصلاحياتُ بلا أن يقرأها الحارس في موضع استعمالها"}
{"id": "uses-as-explicit-key", "file": ".github/workflows/export-pdf.yml", "old": "      - uses: actions/checkout@11d5960a326750d5838078e36cf38b85af677262", "new": "      - ? uses\n        : actions/checkout@v4", "tests": ["tests/test_workflows_hardened.py::test_every_workflow_key_is_plain_so_the_guards_read_what_github_reads"], "why": "مفتاحٌ صريحٌ (`? uses` ثم `: …`) يفكّه قارئُ YAML إلى فعلٍ بوسمٍ يتحرّك ولا يراه قارئُ السطر (مراجعة Codex المستقلّة على efb26d5)"}
{"id": "permissions-as-explicit-key", "file": ".github/workflows/labels.yml", "old": "  sync:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n", "new": "  sync:\n    ? permissions\n    : {contents: write}\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n", "tests": ["tests/test_workflows_hardened.py::test_every_workflow_key_is_plain_so_the_guards_read_what_github_reads"], "why": "صلاحيةُ كتابةٍ بمفتاحٍ صريح (مراجعة Codex المستقلّة على efb26d5)"}
{"id": "step-as-multiline-flow-mapping", "file": ".github/workflows/analysis.yml", "old": "      - uses: actions/checkout@11d5960a326750d5838078e36cf38b85af677262", "new": "      - [\n        {uses: actions/checkout@v4}]", "tests": ["tests/test_workflows_hardened.py::test_every_workflow_key_is_plain_so_the_guards_read_what_github_reads"], "why": "فعلٌ في خريطةٍ مضمَّنة تبدأ سطرَها داخل مجموعةٍ ممتدّة على أسطر"}
{"id": "local-composite-action-unscanned", "file": ".github/workflows/issue-ledger.yml", "old": "      - uses: actions/checkout@11d5960a326750d5838078e36cf38b85af677262", "new": "      - uses: ./.github/actions/wrapper", "tests": ["tests/test_workflows_hardened.py::test_every_external_action_is_pinned_to_a_full_commit"], "why": "فعلٌ مركّبٌ محلّيٌّ لا يُفحص ملفُّه فيستدعي فعلًا بوسمٍ يتحرّك (ملاحظة Codex على #297)"}
{"id": "comment-fakes-a-block-scalar", "file": ".github/workflows/labels.yml", "old": "jobs:\n  sync:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n", "new": "jobs: # : |\n  sync:\n    \"permiss\\u0069ons\": write-all\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n", "tests": ["tests/test_workflows_hardened.py::test_every_workflow_key_is_plain_so_the_guards_read_what_github_reads"], "why": "مؤشّرُ كتلةٍ في تعليق `jobs: # : |` يُخفي شجرةَ jobs كلَّها عن الحرّاس، فتمرّ صلاحيةُ write-all بمفتاحٍ مهروب (مراجعة Codex المستقلّة على c507294)"}
{"id": "comment-fakes-a-block-over-steps", "file": ".github/workflows/mutation-check.yml", "old": "    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@11d5960a326750d5838078e36cf38b85af677262", "new": "    steps: # : |\n      - \"us\\u0065s\": actions/checkout@v4", "tests": ["tests/test_workflows_hardened.py::test_every_workflow_key_is_plain_so_the_guards_read_what_github_reads"], "why": "مؤشّرُ كتلةٍ في تعليق `steps:` يُخفي الخطواتِ فيمرّ فعلٌ بوسمٍ يتحرّك بمفتاحٍ مهروب"}
